{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa: Dinner for Four"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Stories From the Stove"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Looking to the Stars > Indira Gandhi"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Identify and describe personal and regional eating habits and cooking in a range of communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le03ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking about past habits"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " \u201cUsed to\u201d and \u201cwould\u201d express an action that occurred regularly in the past.<br>You use <span class=\"strong\">Wh- questions</span> and <span class=\"strong\">yes/no questions</span> to ask about past habits.<br/> You use questions in <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> to ask about experiences.<br/> You use questions in <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> to ask about specific facts in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use used to do to talk about the past. It is not a tense but it is like a tense. We use used to do for the past only.<br />  We use would to describe the pattern of action in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Auxiliary<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Have <br/>Has</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ Subject <br/>you/I/we/they <br/>she/he</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ ever\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ <span class=\\\"italic\\\">verb in past participle</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Have</span> you ever <span class=\"italic\">had</span> an accident cooking? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Have</span> you ever <span class=\"italic\">burned</span> anything? </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">WH (optional)<br/>What/where/when <br/>Why/how</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ Auxiliary <br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did <br/>Was <br/>Were</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ Subject <br/>you/we/I/they <br/>he/she <br/>you/we/I/they</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ verb in base form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Did</span> anything not turn out the way you wanted?<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Was</span> Vanessa always the perfect chef?<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> Peter use to cook a lot?<br/> <span class=\"strong\">What</span> did Vanessa's mom used to do?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " How much is enough?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use <span class=\"strong\">quantifiers</span> when we want to give someone information about the number of something: how much or how many."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use quantifiers with both countable and uncountable nouns. Look at the chart to learn more:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Only with uncountable nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" With uncountable and countable nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Only with countable nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">How much?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">How much? How many</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">How many?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"no/none\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a few\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a bit (of)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"not any\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a number (of)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"some (any)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"several\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a great deal of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a lot of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a large number of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a large amount of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"plenty of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a great number of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lots of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I used follow recipes very closely, but now I have a sense of how much is enough."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I used to make a lot of mistakes and burn my food a number of times."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to burn"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to heat or cook a piece of food 